    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your experience to the next level with this innovative \u201cBiosynthetic Incubator Aquarium\u201d featuring thousands of automaton cells!\ud83e\udda0 Inspired by the life simulator from mathematician Conway\u2019s incredible \u2018Game of Life\ud83e\uddec\u2019. Embark on an incremental \u2018Idle\u2019 adventure where the goal is to colonize and evolve a new species on Earth, where experimentation\ud83e\uddebto survive is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/a9c3f958ee95bc78d01f4544cd4bfd50.poster.avif?t=1746547304\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/a9c3f958ee95bc78d01f4544cd4bfd50.webm?t=1746547304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/a9c3f958ee95bc78d01f4544cd4bfd50.mp4?t=1746547304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your colony whenever conditions are optimal, create organic structures to generate energy and feed the cells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/76fd7b4e81074a844a55ed7ac0a16286.avif?t=1746547304\" data-has-big width=800 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or create an immune system to defend against parasites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/c9e5daede216ae32dd071deffa67550c.poster.avif?t=1746547304\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/c9e5daede216ae32dd071deffa67550c.webm?t=1746547304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/c9e5daede216ae32dd071deffa67550c.mp4?t=1746547304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multicellular organisms, collect essential molecules and foster chemical bonds essential for life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/f3a693f066cf34cb574f7954a9521426.avif?t=1746547304\" data-has-big width=800 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perfect combination of chemical elements will be crucial for prosperity, although it will not always be easy to reproduce it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/611ac85ca1c4feeab068d0eaf25a9d56.avif?t=1746547304\" data-has-big width=800 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a wide variety of mini-games that will catapult you towards colony improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/846fe828949be57581d911b8c39771b6.avif?t=1746547304\" data-has-big width=800 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the birth of a new species based on just four mathematical rules to create a vibrant and innovative colony you can't miss!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your experience to the next level with this innovative \u201cBiosynthetic Incubator Aquarium\u201d featuring thousands of automaton cells!\ud83e\udda0 Inspired by the life simulator from mathematician Conway\u2019s incredible \u2018Game of Life\ud83e\uddec\u2019. Embark on an incremental \u2018Idle\u2019 adventure where the goal is to colonize and evolve a new species on Earth, where experimentation\ud83e\uddebto survive is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/a9c3f958ee95bc78d01f4544cd4bfd50.poster.avif?t=1746547304\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/a9c3f958ee95bc78d01f4544cd4bfd50.webm?t=1746547304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/a9c3f958ee95bc78d01f4544cd4bfd50.mp4?t=1746547304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your colony whenever conditions are optimal, create organic structures to generate energy and feed the cells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/76fd7b4e81074a844a55ed7ac0a16286.avif?t=1746547304\" data-has-big width=800 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or create an immune system to defend against parasites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/c9e5daede216ae32dd071deffa67550c.poster.avif?t=1746547304\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/c9e5daede216ae32dd071deffa67550c.webm?t=1746547304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/c9e5daede216ae32dd071deffa67550c.mp4?t=1746547304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multicellular organisms, collect essential molecules and foster chemical bonds essential for life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/f3a693f066cf34cb574f7954a9521426.avif?t=1746547304\" data-has-big width=800 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perfect combination of chemical elements will be crucial for prosperity, although it will not always be easy to reproduce it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/611ac85ca1c4feeab068d0eaf25a9d56.avif?t=1746547304\" data-has-big width=800 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a wide variety of mini-games that will catapult you towards colony improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/846fe828949be57581d911b8c39771b6.avif?t=1746547304\" data-has-big width=800 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the birth of a new species based on just four mathematical rules to create a vibrant and innovative colony you can't miss!</p>",
